# 🛡️ 애드센스 필수 방어막 페이지 템플릿

대표님! 구글 애드센스 심사관(로봇)이 가장 좋아하고 신뢰하는 **필수 3종 페이지 템플릿**입니다. 
Blogger 관리자 메뉴에서 **[페이지] -> [새 페이지]**를 클릭하신 후, 아래 내용을 복사해서 붙여넣기만 하시면 됩니다! (HTML 보기 모드로 붙여넣으시면 더욱 좋습니다.)

---

## 1. Privacy Policy (개인정보처리방침)

**페이지 제목**: Privacy Policy

**내용**:
```html
<h2>Privacy Policy for 그대들의 블로그</h2>

<p>At 그대들의 블로그 (leesjui.blogspot.com), accessible from https://leesjui.blogspot.com, one of our main priorities is the privacy of our visitors. This Privacy Policy document contains types of information that is collected and recorded by 그대들의 블로그 and how we use it.</p>

<p>If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us.</p>

<h3>Log Files</h3>
<p>그대들의 블로그 follows a standard procedure of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. All hosting companies do this and a part of hosting services' analytics. The information collected by log files include internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable.</p>

<h3>Cookies and Web Beacons</h3>
<p>Like any other website, 그대들의 블로그 uses 'cookies'. These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and/or other information.</p>

<h3>Google DoubleClick DART Cookie</h3>
<p>Google is one of a third-party vendor on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to www.website.com and other sites on the internet. However, visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL – <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a></p>

<h3>Consent</h3>
<p>By using our website, you hereby consent to our Privacy Policy and agree to its Terms and Conditions.</p>
```

---

## 2. Terms of Service (이용약관)

**페이지 제목**: Terms of Service

**내용**:
```html
<h2>Terms of Service</h2>

<p>Welcome to 그대들의 블로그!</p>
<p>These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of 그대들의 블로그's Website, located at https://leesjui.blogspot.com.</p>

<p>By accessing this website we assume you accept these terms and conditions. Do not continue to use 그대들의 블로그 if you do not agree to take all of the terms and conditions stated on this page.</p>

<h3>License</h3>
<p>Unless otherwise stated, 그대들의 블로그 and/or its licensors own the intellectual property rights for all material on 그대들의 블로그. All intellectual property rights are reserved. You may access this from 그대들의 블로그 for your own personal use subjected to restrictions set in these terms and conditions.</p>

<p>You must not:</p>
<ul>
    <li>Republish material from 그대들의 블로그</li>
    <li>Sell, rent or sub-license material from 그대들의 블로그</li>
    <li>Reproduce, duplicate or copy material from 그대들의 블로그</li>
    <li>Redistribute content from 그대들의 블로그</li>
</ul>

<h3>Disclaimer</h3>
<p>To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, we exclude all representations, warranties and conditions relating to our website and the use of this website. The information on this blog is provided for general informational purposes only, especially regarding pet health.</p>
```

---

## 3. About Us / Contact (소개 및 연락처)

**페이지 제목**: About Us

**내용**:
```html
<h2>About Us</h2>

<p>Welcome to <strong>그대들의 블로그</strong>! 🐾</p>

<p>Hello! We are passionate about providing the best and most reliable information regarding pet health, care, and well-being. Our mission is to help pet owners understand their furry friends better, covering topics from dog allergies to grooming and emergency care.</p>

<p>We strive to create a healthy and happy community for pets and their owners. Thank you for visiting our blog, and we hope you find our content helpful and engaging!</p>

<h3>Contact Us</h3>
<p>If you have any questions, suggestions, or just want to say hello, feel free to reach out to us!</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Email:</strong> (대표님의 실제 이메일 주소를 여기에 적어주세요. 예: example@gmail.com)</li>
    <li><strong>Website:</strong> https://leesjui.blogspot.com</li>
</ul>
<p>We will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>
```

---

> [!TIP]
> **💡 코다리의 꿀팁**
> 페이지를 만드신 후, 블로그의 **상단 메뉴(Nav bar)**나 **하단(Footer)**에 방금 만든 3개 페이지의 링크를 꼭! 추가해 주셔야 합니다. 구글 봇이 홈페이지에 들어왔을 때 이 링크들을 쉽게 찾아야 승인을 내어줍니다.
